# Vendor flag SVGs, copied from country-flag-icons by tool/copy-flags.mjs.
# Not committed: 267 files, 1.3MB, and regenerating them from the locked
# dependency is what keeps them from drifting out of step with it.
/public/flags

# The salon page's generated test photo (tool/test-photo.mjs). Regenerated, never
# committed: the PR and the manual LCP runs use it, and no binary goes into git.
/tool/out

# No photo is committed under web/: salons' photos live on R2, the brand is SVG and PNG, and
# the one test photo is drawn by tool/test-photo.mjs. A JPEG here is a measuring run's
# output or a demo photo (BACKLOG 37: licence unknown) on its way into `git add -A`, so it
# is ignored wherever it lands, not only in /tool/out. One really meant to be committed is
# added with `git add -f`, and the PR says why.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.JPG
*.JPEG
